rubrics_metrics.guidance:
Steps: Go to the main conference group edit page: https://openreview.net/group/edit?id=<insert_your_venue_id>. Scroll down to "Group Content" and click 'show content'. In the editor, add the variable exactly as shown:

"enable_reviewers_reassignment": {
  "value": true
}

Then click 'Update Content' to save the changes. This toggles the feature allowing Area Chairs to modify reviewer assignments after assignments are deployed.

Steps: Go to the main conference group edit page: https://openreview.net/group/edit?id=<insert_your_venue_id>. Scroll down to "Group Content" and click 'show content'. In the editor, add the variable exactly as shown:

"reviewers_proposed_assignment_title": {
  "value": "matcher1"
}

Replace "matcher1" with the title of the matching configuration you want Area Chairs to modify. Then click 'Update Content' to save the changes. This exposes the specified proposed assignment configuration for Area Chair edits prior to deployment.
